From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:57:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Decompile the boss start/BGM title/demo callbacks
 and randring 1 after the stage loop

nullfunc_false() returns int (xor ax, ax), and the resident demo number is
unsigned (bytewise comparisons against 1, 2 and 3).
---
